4ddf-a7eb-f7fcfb3b900d","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"ありがとうございます！","ts":"1615458019.031600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g1M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f617a1b0-87ac-4f61-b038-54736318b9de","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"そのような表記に修正しました！","ts":"1615457992.031400","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1615458850.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8eq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56a14498-15df-477d-9ad2-0d33a77aa5c2","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"というと、integer/binary/octal…を並列に扱うのではなく(binary/ocatl/etcは型ではないので)、\nnumberの表記の仕方としてdecimal/octal/binaryを扱うといった形でしょうか?","ts":"1615457450.031000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Xl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c69e8434-f03b-435f-b936-b9947b6e49e7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとちょっとだけ気になったのが、literalのinteger、これoctalやbinaryと比較で書くならdecimalとかのほうがよいかも?","ts":"1615456717.027600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tV8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b150c754-d7cd-4a4d-98f1-03ee9d1837eb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"たぶんよさそう","ts":"1615456664.026700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"panda_dogeza","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LJzx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a0bb46f-4163-42af-989b-4200cf40e725","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"と、すると`is`はList,Dict,Blob,(String 文字列同士の比較(一応使える))で使えると書くといいですかね?","ts":"1615456275.025800","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1615456476.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FMS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc2830cc-b5a1-45ac-b0f1-c7aa2be70292","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"is使いたいならwrapするしかない","ts":"1615456131.023600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Hoy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d048dd6-17e9-445c-8ec8-eaac8b6262be","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですね、見た目はわかりやすいか","ts":"1615456129.023400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3LGV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7524e44-afd3-4c49-afcf-670e39b87fa4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"文字列は文字列の比較が走りますね、Vim scriptでやっても","ts":"1615456114.022800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MIuek"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49780b2b-2cbd-42ed-9a01-bc97cd2cfa2c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"でも文字列はやらんほうがいいだろうなあ","ts":"1615456093.022000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A5yB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fbed612-8048-46ce-85b3-7c91be5aaa0e","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"```var x = [1, 2]\nvar y = x\necho x is y # -\u0026gt; true```\n```var x = [1, 2]\nvar y = [1, 2]\necho x is y # -\u0026gt; false```\nなるほど。","ts":"1615456089.021800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x99SQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3800f7d-87d6-4c61-822a-937a9ef0eb55","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"基本はLIst、Dict、Blob、やって文字列?でしたっけ","ts":"1615456083.021600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u49"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db5b1a2e-10f7-47b6-902e-b42f7c1ccd81","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そもそもisというのがポインタの等値比較をする演算子なので値に使うべきではない、ということなのかも","ts":"1615455949.020200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CH1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bea297f8-b265-4842-a90f-ae0a46f18aae","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"ちょっとここら辺の理解があやしいです","ts":"1615455915.019200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qEjSK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58128e1e-9bb4-43b7-a0cb-6fc88fc639dd","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"はい。例えば↓のように書くと、`E1037 Cannot use \"is\" with number` とエラーが出るんですよね。\nVim scriptでは`1 is 1` 1になるのでどう挙動が変わったか把握できなくて…\n```vim9script\n\nvar [x, y] = [1, 2]\necho x is y```","ts":"1615455816.018800","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1615455863.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TNs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38b84f27-06d6-4484-b5d1-26e38e13f01f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(そもそも文字列の実体を利用しようとするなという話ではある)","ts":"1615455815.018700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0xOV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94d72fe5-5ff2-4b25-a5b2-f2d5f1ba57c2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"is、文字列相手に使うと期待した動作をしてくれないなどあって厳しかった","ts":"1615455794.017700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hETs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5cca4e2-2aca-468f-a636-bf44d5d37c36","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"挙動が難しいからどう書けばいいのか...ですね","ts":"1615455706.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+LiK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6de4e80d-29d6-4c66-93c2-b6235353c68f","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"少し時間ください","ts":"1615455683.015700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text"